cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tragweite in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tragweite: Simulation-Based Design Planning for Precision Psychotherapy Studies"
authors:
  - family-names: "Obeser"
    given-names: "Christian"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chrisobeser/tragweite"
url: "https://github.com/chrisobeser/tragweite"
abstract: >-
  Simulation-based power and design-sensitivity analysis for
  treatment-effect heterogeneity and patient-therapist matching
  effects under therapist nesting (caseloads, intraclass
  correlations, session counts), built on the validated windkanal
  simulation engine. For these questions no closed-form power
  formulas exist; the package answers them by simulation against
  known truth.
keywords:
  - power-analysis
  - study-design
  - psychotherapy-research
  - heterogeneous-treatment-effects
  - multilevel-models
  - R-package
